Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.40,0:00:04.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I always sat in the back seat growing\Nup.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.40,0:00:10.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Watching my older siblings take the\Nwheel.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.00,0:00:18.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Then came the day I sat in the driver's\Nseat.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.00,0:00:23.49,Default,,0,0,0,,My hands gripped the wheel so tight.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.60,0:00:29.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Checking the mirror over and over.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.20,0:00:37.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Now my phone lights up, day or night.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.20,0:00:43.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I drive my sisters home at night.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.80,0:00:50.93,Default,,0,0,0,,By day, I take my parents on their\Nerrands.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.40,0:00:57.19,Default,,0,0,0,,The little ones sit on my lap and hold\Nthe wheel.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.00,0:01:04.13,Default,,0,0,0,,The quiet kid from the back seat...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.60,0:01:10.28,Default,,0,0,0,,...is the one who brings everyone home.
